  "lessons": [
    "Releasing the mouse used to start cropping at once; now Enter confirms, so the box can be adjusted first.",
    "The size question used to come halfway through the batch. Planning now reads only image headers and asks first, so 'no' never leaves half a batch.",
    "Upper-case extensions such as .JPG used to be skipped; now any letter case counts, and pictures go in name order."
  ],
